# AI Usage Log — Angelina

## Entry 1 — Generate Baseline User Stories and Tasks

**Task ID/Title:** Task 1.1: Generate 10 initial user stories 

**Date:** September 20, 2026  

**Responsible Person:** Angelina Yajaira Montano  

**AI Tool:** Claude  

**Purpose of AI Use:** Brainstorming of user stories

**Chat Link or Prompt/Response:** https://claude.ai/share/6fd5e848-f068-4cc1-8d43-bfb3590ce069

**AI-Suggested Content:** Using Claude, the content produced is a list of stories for the job seekers and recruiters of CareerConnect
* **US-01: Account Registration**
  * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to create an account with my email and password so that I can access platform features and save my progress.
  * **Tasks:**
    * Task: Design user schema (job seeker vs. recruiter roles)
    * Task: Build signup API endpoint with password encryption for security
    * Task: Build registration UI form

* **US-02: Recruiter Account Registration**
 * **User story:** As a recruiter, I want to register a company account so that I can post jobs and manage applicants under my organization.
 * **Tasks:**
   * Task: Add company/organization fields to schema
   * Task: Build recruiter-specific signup flow
   * Task: Add role-based access control (recruiter vs. job seeker permissions)

* **US-03: Profile Management**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to build and edit a profile with my skills, education, and work experience so that recruiters can learn more about my background.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Design profile data model
  * Task: Build profile edit UI
  * Task: Implement profile save/update API

* **US-04: Resume Upload**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to upload and store my resume (PDF/DOCX) so that I can attach it to job applications without re-uploading each time.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Implement file upload endpoint with size/type validation
  * Task: Store resume file and link to user profile
  * Task: Build "manage resumes" UI (upload, replace, delete)

* **US-05: Job Posting Management**
 * **User story:** As a recruiter, I want to create, edit, and close job postings so that I can advertise open roles and control which are visible to applicants.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Design job posting schema (title, description, requirements, status)
  * Task: Build create/edit job posting form
  * Task: Implement open/close posting status logic

* **US-06: Job Search and Filtering**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to search and filter job postings by keyword, location, and job type so that I can quickly find relevant opportunities.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Build search/filter API with query parameters
  * Task: Implement filter UI (location, job type, keyword)
  * Task: Add pagination for search results

* **US-07: Job Application Submission**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to submit an application to a job posting using my saved resume and profile so that I don't have to redo work for each application.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Build "apply" button/flow linking resume + profile to a job
  * Task: Implement application submission API
  * Task: Prevent duplicate applications to the same posting

* **US-08: Application Status Tracking**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to view the status of each application (Applied, Interview, Offered, Rejected) so that I can track my progress across all my job searches.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Add status field with allowed transitions to application model
  * Task: Build recruiter UI to update applicant status
  * Task: Build job seeker dashboard showing status per application

* **US-09: Saved Jobs / Favorites**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to save job postings to a favorites list so that I can revisit them later without searching again.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Implement save/unsave job endpoint
  * Task: Build "saved jobs" list view
  * Task: Add save/favorite icon to job listing UI

* **US-10: AI-Assisted Resume Feedback**
 * **User story:** As a job seeker, I want to receive AI-generated feedback on my resume compared to a specific job posting so that I can improve my chances of getting noticed by recruiters.
 * **Tasks:**
  * Task: Integrate AI API (e.g., resume text + job description as input)
  * Task: Design prompt to generate structured feedback (strengths, gaps, suggestions)
  * Task: Build UI to display AI feedback alongside the job posting

### Validation

Each of the user stories generated were compared to the required system features of the Sprint 1 document to see if they needed specification.
* **For US-01:** It matches the requirement of user registration and authentication for job seekers but it did not cover the security aspect with the password encryption
* **For US-02:** It matches the requirement of a user role specific to a recruiter that cannot be controlled by the other user type of job seeker
* **For US-03:** It matches the profile management feature with the possibility of editing the profile.
* **For US-04:** It matches the feature of resume upload and management
* **For US-05:** It matches the feature of job posting management for recruiters
* **For US-06:** It matches the feature of job search and filtering capabilities.
* **For US-07:** It matches the feature of job application submission
* **For US-08:** It matches the feature of application status tracking with the labels(Applied, Interview, Offered, Rejected).
* **For US-09:** It matches the feature of saved jobs and favourites.
* **For US-10:** It matches the feature of AI-assisted resume feedback or job matching suggestions


### Decision

**Modified and Accepted**

### Reflection

AI on Claude managed to generate user stories that fulfill some system features but there are still two missing from the list: 
1.	Application history dashboard.
2.	Notifications and reminders for application deadlines.
As a team, we have to discuss and brainstorm to implement these two features in the 5 user stories required for the Sprint 1 deliverable.
  

Responsible Person: Angelina Yajaira Montano

## Entry 2 — Generate specific tasks for the user stories brainstormed by the whole team

**Task ID/Title:** Task 1.2: Generate tasks for the 5 user stories discussed by the team

**Date:** September 27, 2026  

**Responsible Person:** Angelina Yajaira Montano  

**AI Tool:** Claude  

**Purpose of AI Use:** Brainstorming of tasks

**Chat Link or Prompt/Response:** https://claude.ai/chat/4b6e8755-2a22-4fa1-95b5-4a21c921e793

**AI-Suggested Content:** Using Claude, the content produced is a list of tasks for the technical steps that need be taken in order to implement the features that the whole team generated in our meetings

* **US-11: Application Dashboard**

* Task: Design the dashboard wireframe/layout (summary cards + chart placement).
* Task: Implement backend endpoint to aggregate application data by status (Applied, Interview, Offered, Rejected) and time period.
* Task: Build frontend dashboard page with summary stat cards (total applications, response rate, etc.).
* Task: Integrate a charting library (e.g., Chart.js) to visualize application breakdown and trends.
* Task: Write tests for the aggregation logic and dashboard rendering.

* **US-12: Notifications and Reminders**

* Task: Design schema for storing deadline/reminder records linked to applications
* Task: Implement backend logic (scheduled job or check-on-load) to detect upcoming deadlines
* Task: Implement API endpoints to create, fetch, and dismiss notifications
* Task: Build UI notification component (e.g. bell icon + dropdown/list)

* **US-13: Community Posts**

* Task: Design schema for posts (title, content, category — networking/hackathon/workshop, author, timestamp)
* Task: Implement API endpoints to create and list community posts
* Task: Build UI form for creating a new post
* Task: Build UI feed to browse/view posts

* **US-14: Hashtags Under Profile Picture**

* Task: Extend user profile schema to store hashtags/skill tags
* Task: Implement API endpoint to add/edit/remove hashtags on a profile
* Task: Build UI component to display and edit hashtags on the profile page
* Task: Add input validation (max count, format, duplicate checks)

* **US-15: Messaging System**

* Task: Design schema for conversations and messages between users
* Task: Implement API endpoints to send and retrieve messages
* Task: Build UI messaging interface (conversation list + chat window)
* Task: Add real-time or polling-based updates for new messages

### Validation

The tasks for the first two user stories that the team produced match the requirements for the two system features missing from the ones generated by Claude AI in the entry 1.1 of this log


* **For US-11:** It matches the requirement of a dashboard available to the job seeker on his profile page but task 11.2 present in the chat is redundant because it is already present in the US-08 (Ai asnwer: Task 11.2: Implement backend endpoint to aggregate application data by status (Applied, Interview, Offered, Rejected) and time period.) so it was removed
* **For US-12:** It matches the requirement of a having notifications and reminders about applications deadlines

The tasks for the last three features brainstormed by the team go over the features required in the Sprint 1 document so a manual review was done on each of them to determine if the tasks need to be modified before they can be used in the project

* **For US-13:** The tasks cover the steps needed for that feature, they go over the categories and the interface relevant to implement the feature

* **For US-14:**The tasks include the steps to add and edit hashtags and input validation which is important for the length of the hashtags

* **For US-15:** The tasks describes the interface needed for a messaging system

### Decision

**Modified and Accepted**

### Reflection

The tasks will be added under the part on team-generated user stories to fulfill the Sprint 1 requirements.

**Responsible Person:** Angelina Yajaira Montano

